WEBVTT

00:03:58.885 --> 00:04:02.761
and releasing it and catapulting
like a slingshot.

00:04:02.785 --> 00:04:04.672
And it even does gymnastics.

00:04:05.688 --> 00:04:06.859
Yay.

00:04:06.883 --> 00:04:08.320
(Laughter)

00:04:08.828 --> 00:04:13.005
So I just showed you
what a single robogami can do.

00:04:13.029 --> 00:04:15.814
Imagine what they can do as a group.

00:04:15.838 --> 00:04:19.860
They can join forces to tackle
more complex tasks.

00:04:19.884 --> 00:04:23.046
Each module, either active or passive,

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.637
we can assemble them
to create different shapes.

00:04:26.661 --> 00:04:29.410
Not only that, by controlling
the folding joints,

00:04:29.434 --> 00:04:33.982
we're able to create and attack
different tasks.